oints", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About Things That Are Probable", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the modal <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to talk about things that are probable.<br/>When something is probable, it may happen or it may not happen.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Statement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">It should be around here.<br/> It should be on the right.<br/></span><span class = \\\"italic\\\">The mall should be open today.<span/><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">The map should be on the first floor.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">It is probably around here.<br/>It is likely there.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm quite sure the mall is open today.<br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">The map is almost certainly on the first floor.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The shop should be on the right.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The mall map should be around here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It should be upstairs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It should be on the upper floor.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "upper", "type": "name"}, {"content": "higher; above here", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That store is on the upper floor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about a shopping center.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "floor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a level in a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The coffee shop is on the 2nd floor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get off", "type": "name"}, {"content": " leave a bus or train", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Get off the bus at the next stop.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "first", "type": "name"}, {"content": "before other things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to shop for shoes first.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hall", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a long space between rooms in buildings", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Go down the hall and turn right. The coffee shop is there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "metal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a material like gold, silver or iron", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The shopping center has large metal doors. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a mall map in a mall or online. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose two stores in different areas or on different levels.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write how to get to the store from the entrance.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to show something is probable.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use prepositions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 20 to 30 words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your directions to a friend.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about possibility.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about location.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 20 to 30 words about two stores.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my directions aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}